{"seq":3,"slug":"tech-talk-english","title":"技术演讲英语","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/programmer-english/communication-english/tech-talk-english","wordCount":1304,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"技术演讲英语\">技术演讲英语</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>技术演讲是一种<strong>有固定节奏的独白</strong>：开场建立信任、主体用衔接句与类比讲清内容、演示边操作边解说、Q&amp;A 应对提问、结尾给可带走的要点。每一段都有成熟的句式模板，把它们连起来就是一场完整演讲。</p>\n<p>演讲英语的三条贯穿原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>前三 30 秒定生死</strong>：开场要同时完成建立信任、激发兴趣、设定期望</li>\n<li><strong>复杂概念靠类比与分步</strong>：<code>Think of it like...</code> + <code>Let me break this down into three steps</code></li>\n<li><strong>Q&amp;A 的&quot;不知道&quot;要软着陆</strong>：不硬答、不敷衍，用&quot;承诺 follow-up&quot;或&quot;邀请群体智慧&quot;接住</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[技术演讲英语] --&gt; B[开场 建立信任与期望]&#10;    A --&gt; C[主体 衔接与类比]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Live Demo 边做边说]&#10;    A --&gt; E[Q&amp;A 应对]&#10;    A --&gt; F[结尾 可带走要点]&#10;    B --&gt; G[自我介绍 2-3 句 + 话题引入]&#10;    C --&gt; H[转折句 + 类比 + 分步]&#10;    D --&gt; I[解说操作 + 处理出错]&#10;    E --&gt; J[直接答 / 需思考 / 不知道 / 转化讨论]&#10;    F --&gt; K[总结要点 + 后续资源]&#10;    G --&gt; L[听众跟上节奏]&#10;    H --&gt; L&#10;    J --&gt; L\">graph TD\n    A[技术演讲英语] --&gt; B[开场 建立信任与期望]\n    A --&gt; C[主体 衔接与类比]\n    A --&gt; D[Live Demo 边做边说]\n    A --&gt; E[Q&amp;A 应对]\n    A --&gt; F[结尾 可带走要点]\n    B --&gt; G[自我介绍 2-3 句 + 话题引入]\n    C --&gt; H[转折句 + 类比 + 分步]\n    D --&gt; I[解说操作 + 处理出错]\n    E --&gt; J[直接答 / 需思考 / 不知道 / 转化讨论]\n    F --&gt; K[总结要点 + 后续资源]\n    G --&gt; L[听众跟上节奏]\n    H --&gt; L\n    J --&gt; L</pre><p>线上 Tech Talk 在此之上多了三个约束——视觉信号弱、网络延迟、参与者多任务——因此需要额外适配：远程语境开场、网络故障套语、以及 Q&amp;A 的结构化复述。</p>\n<h2 id=\"开场白的设计\">开场白的设计</h2><p>技术演讲的前 30 秒决定了听众是否会全程投入。好的开场要同时完成三个任务：建立信任（你是谁）、激发兴趣（为什么要听）、设定期望（将获得什么）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"自我介绍\">自我介绍</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Hi everyone. I&#39;m [Name], a senior backend engineer at [Company].&#10;I&#39;ve been working on distributed systems for the past 6 years,&#10;and today I&#39;ll be talking about how we scaled our message queue&#10;to handle 2 million events per second.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Hi everyone. I'm [Name], a senior backend engineer at [Company].</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>I've been working on distributed systems for the past 6 years,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>and today I'll be talking about how we scaled our message queue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>to handle 2 million events per second.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Good morning. My name is [Name]. I work on the infrastructure&#10;team at [Company], where I focus on observability and monitoring.&#10;Today&#39;s talk is about how we built our custom tracing system.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Good morning. My name is [Name]. I work on the infrastructure</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>team at [Company], where I focus on observability and monitoring.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Today's talk is about how we built our custom tracing system.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>保持自我介绍在 2-3 句内。听众关心的不是你的完整简历，而是你的相关经验为何使你有资格讲这个话题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"话题引入模式\">话题引入模式</h3><p><strong>问题导入</strong>——最有效的开场之一：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;How many of you have been paged at 3 AM because of a cascading failure?&quot;&#10;[pause for hands]&#10;&quot;Today I&#39;ll show you three patterns that could have prevented every&#10;single one of those incidents.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"How many of you have been paged at 3 AM because of a cascading failure?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[pause for hands]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Today I'll show you three patterns that could have prevented every</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>single one of those incidents.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>数据导入</strong>——用数字建立紧迫性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Last year, our team spent 40% of engineering time on incident response.&#10;This year, after implementing what I&#39;m about to share, that number&#10;dropped to 8%. Let me show you how.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Last year, our team spent 40% of engineering time on incident response.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>This year, after implementing what I'm about to share, that number</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dropped to 8%. Let me show you how.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>故事导入</strong>——用叙事吸引注意力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Six months ago, we received a bill from our cloud provider that was&#10;3x our usual amount. The culprit? A single misconfigured auto-scaling&#10;policy. That incident kicked off the project I&#39;m going to present today.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Six months ago, we received a bill from our cloud provider that was</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3x our usual amount. The culprit? A single misconfigured auto-scaling</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>policy. That incident kicked off the project I'm going to present today.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"大纲预告\">大纲预告</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Here&#39;s what we&#39;ll cover today:&quot;&#10;&quot;I&#39;ve structured this talk into three parts:&quot;&#10;&quot;By the end of this session, you&#39;ll understand:&quot;&#10;&quot;We&#39;ll go through this in four stages:&quot;&#10;&quot;The agenda for today is:&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Here's what we'll cover today:\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I've structured this talk into three parts:\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"By the end of this session, you'll understand:\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"We'll go through this in four stages:\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"The agenda for today is:\"</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;I&#39;ll start with the problem statement, then walk through our solution&#10;architecture, show you a live demo, and wrap up with lessons learned&#10;and some gotchas to watch out for.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"I'll start with the problem statement, then walk through our solution</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>architecture, show you a live demo, and wrap up with lessons learned</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>and some gotchas to watch out for.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"幻灯片衔接与内容讲解\">幻灯片衔接与内容讲解</h2><h3 id=\"幻灯片切换句式\">幻灯片切换句式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Let&#39;s move on to...&quot;&#10;&quot;Now, shifting our focus to...&quot;&#10;&quot;That brings us to the next point...&quot;&#10;&quot;Building on what we just discussed...&quot;&#10;&quot;With that context in mind, let&#39;s look at...&quot;&#10;&quot;Okay, so that&#39;s the problem. Now let&#39;s talk about the solution.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Let's move on to...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Now, shifting our focus to...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"That brings us to the next point...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Building on what we just discussed...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"With that context in mind, let's look at...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Okay, so that's the problem. Now let's talk about the solution.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"解释图表和架构图\">解释图表和架构图</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;As you can see in this diagram...&quot;&#10;&quot;On the left side, we have... and on the right...&quot;&#10;&quot;The arrows here represent the data flow between...&quot;&#10;&quot;Let me walk you through this architecture step by step.&quot;&#10;&quot;The key component here is this middleware layer, which...&quot;&#10;&quot;Notice how the request flows from the client through...&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"As you can see in this diagram...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"On the left side, we have... and on the right...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"The arrows here represent the data flow between...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Let me walk you through this architecture step by step.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"The key component here is this middleware layer, which...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Notice how the request flows from the client through...\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"描述数据与指标\">描述数据与指标</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;This graph shows our latency over the past 30 days.&quot;&#10;&quot;The blue line represents the p99, and the green line is the median.&quot;&#10;&quot;As you can see, there&#39;s a significant drop right here — that&#39;s when&#10;we deployed the optimization.&quot;&#10;&quot;This accounts for roughly 40% of total traffic.&quot;&#10;&quot;The ratio of reads to writes is approximately 8 to 1.&quot;&#10;&quot;We went from 500ms to under 50ms — a 10x improvement.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"This graph shows our latency over the past 30 days.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"The blue line represents the p99, and the green line is the median.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"As you can see, there's a significant drop right here — that's when</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>we deployed the optimization.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"This accounts for roughly 40% of total traffic.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"The ratio of reads to writes is approximately 8 to 1.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"We went from 500ms to under 50ms — a 10x improvement.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"解释复杂概念\">解释复杂概念</h3><p><strong>使用类比</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Think of it like a highway with multiple lanes.&#10;When traffic gets heavy, we add more lanes — that&#39;s horizontal scaling.&quot;&#10;&#10;&quot;It&#39;s similar to how a library uses a card catalog.&#10;Instead of searching every book, you look up the index first.&quot;&#10;&#10;&quot;Imagine a restaurant kitchen. The load balancer is the host who&#10;seats guests at different tables to distribute the workload evenly.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Think of it like a highway with multiple lanes.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>When traffic gets heavy, we add more lanes — that's horizontal scaling.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"It's similar to how a library uses a card catalog.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Instead of searching every book, you look up the index first.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Imagine a restaurant kitchen. The load balancer is the host who</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>seats guests at different tables to distribute the workload evenly.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>逐步分解</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Let me break this down into three steps.&quot;&#10;&quot;At a high level, here&#39;s what happens:&quot;&#10;&quot;First... then... finally...&quot;&#10;&quot;The key insight is...&quot;&#10;&quot;In other words...&quot;&#10;&quot;To put it simply...&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Let me break this down into three steps.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"At a high level, here's what happens:\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"First... then... finally...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"The key insight is...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"In other words...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"To put it simply...\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"live-demo-的英语表达\">Live Demo 的英语表达</h2><h3 id=\"开始演示\">开始演示</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Let me switch to a live demo now.&quot;&#10;&quot;I&#39;m going to show you how this actually works in practice.&quot;&#10;&quot;Let me pull up the terminal/IDE.&quot;&#10;&quot;Okay, let me show you this in action.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Let me switch to a live demo now.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I'm going to show you how this actually works in practice.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Let me pull up the terminal/IDE.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Okay, let me show you this in action.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"边操作边解说\">边操作边解说</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;So here I&#39;m creating a new instance of...&quot;&#10;&quot;Now I&#39;ll run the migration script...&quot;&#10;&quot;Watch what happens when I send this request...&quot;&#10;&quot;Notice the response time here — under 10 milliseconds.&quot;&#10;&quot;Let me add a breakpoint here so we can see...&quot;&#10;&quot;As you can see in the logs, the event was processed successfully.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"So here I'm creating a new instance of...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Now I'll run the migration script...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Watch what happens when I send this request...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Notice the response time here — under 10 milliseconds.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Let me add a breakpoint here so we can see...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"As you can see in the logs, the event was processed successfully.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"处理演示出错\">处理演示出错</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Ah, that&#39;s not what I expected. Let me check... ah, I see — I forgot to...&quot;&#10;&quot;Okay, looks like the demo gods aren&#39;t cooperating today.&#10;Let me switch to a pre-recorded version.&quot;&#10;&quot;Interesting — this actually demonstrates why error handling is important.&#10;Let me fix this and retry.&quot;&#10;&quot;That&#39;s actually a good example of the failure mode I mentioned earlier.&quot;&#10;&quot;Let me restart the service. While that&#39;s spinning up, let me explain&#10;what should happen next.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Ah, that's not what I expected. Let me check... ah, I see — I forgot to...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Okay, looks like the demo gods aren't cooperating today.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Let me switch to a pre-recorded version.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Interesting — this actually demonstrates why error handling is important.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Let me fix this and retry.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"That's actually a good example of the failure mode I mentioned earlier.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Let me restart the service. While that's spinning up, let me explain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>what should happen next.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"q-a-环节应对\">Q&amp;A 环节应对</h2><h3 id=\"开启问答\">开启问答</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;I&#39;d be happy to take questions now.&quot;&#10;&quot;Let&#39;s open it up for questions.&quot;&#10;&quot;I have about 10 minutes for Q&amp;A.&quot;&#10;&quot;Feel free to ask anything — technical questions, clarifications,&#10;or challenges to the approach.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"I'd be happy to take questions now.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Let's open it up for questions.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I have about 10 minutes for Q&#x26;A.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Feel free to ask anything — technical questions, clarifications,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>or challenges to the approach.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"接收问题\">接收问题</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Great question.&quot;&#10;&quot;That&#39;s a really good point.&quot;&#10;&quot;Thanks for bringing that up.&quot;&#10;&quot;I&#39;m glad you asked that.&quot;&#10;&quot;Let me make sure I understand your question...&quot;&#10;&quot;Could you clarify what you mean by...?&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Great question.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"That's a really good point.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Thanks for bringing that up.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I'm glad you asked that.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Let me make sure I understand your question...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Could you clarify what you mean by...?\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"回答模式\">回答模式</h3><p><strong>直接回答</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Yes, exactly. We handle that by...&quot;&#10;&quot;The short answer is X. Let me elaborate...&quot;&#10;&quot;That&#39;s correct — and here&#39;s why...&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Yes, exactly. We handle that by...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"The short answer is X. Let me elaborate...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"That's correct — and here's why...\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>需要思考时</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;That&#39;s an interesting question. Let me think about that for a moment.&quot;&#10;&quot;Off the top of my head, I&#39;d say...&quot;&#10;&quot;I haven&#39;t encountered that exact scenario, but my intuition says...&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"That's an interesting question. Let me think about that for a moment.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Off the top of my head, I'd say...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I haven't encountered that exact scenario, but my intuition says...\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>不知道答案时</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;That&#39;s a great question, and honestly I don&#39;t have a definitive answer.&#10;Let me follow up with you after the talk.&quot;&#10;&quot;I&#39;m not sure about the specifics, but I can point you to the relevant&#10;documentation.&quot;&#10;&quot;I&#39;d have to look into that more. Can I get back to you?&quot;&#10;&quot;That&#39;s outside my area of expertise, but I think [person] would know.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"That's a great question, and honestly I don't have a definitive answer.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Let me follow up with you after the talk.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I'm not sure about the specifics, but I can point you to the relevant</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>documentation.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I'd have to look into that more. Can I get back to you?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"That's outside my area of expertise, but I think [person] would know.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>将问题转化为讨论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;That&#39;s actually a common trade-off. In our case, we chose X because...&quot;&#10;&quot;Great point — and that leads to an interesting design decision...&quot;&#10;&quot;You&#39;re right that there&#39;s a downside. The way we mitigate it is...&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"That's actually a common trade-off. In our case, we chose X because...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Great point — and that leads to an interesting design decision...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"You're right that there's a downside. The way we mitigate it is...\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"处理挑战性问题\">处理挑战性问题</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;I appreciate the pushback. You&#39;re right that [their point], but&#10;in our specific context, [your reasoning].&quot;&#10;&quot;That&#39;s a valid concern. We considered that and decided the trade-off&#10;was acceptable because...&quot;&#10;&quot;Fair point. This approach isn&#39;t perfect for every use case.&#10;For your scenario, you might want to consider...&quot;&#10;&quot;I think we might be talking about different things.&#10;Let me clarify what I mean by...&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"I appreciate the pushback. You're right that [their point], but</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>in our specific context, [your reasoning].\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"That's a valid concern. We considered that and decided the trade-off</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>was acceptable because...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Fair point. This approach isn't perfect for every use case.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>For your scenario, you might want to consider...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I think we might be talking about different things.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Let me clarify what I mean by...\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"结尾的艺术\">结尾的艺术</h2><h3 id=\"总结要点\">总结要点</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;To wrap up, the three key takeaways are...&quot;&#10;&quot;In summary, what I&#39;d like you to remember is...&quot;&#10;&quot;If there&#39;s one thing I want you to take away from this talk, it&#39;s...&quot;&#10;&quot;Let me leave you with this thought...&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"To wrap up, the three key takeaways are...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"In summary, what I'd like you to remember is...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"If there's one thing I want you to take away from this talk, it's...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Let me leave you with this thought...\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"提供后续资源\">提供后续资源</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;All the code I showed today is available on GitHub at [link].&quot;&#10;&quot;I&#39;ve written a detailed blog post that goes deeper into this topic.&quot;&#10;&quot;The slides are available at [link]. Feel free to screenshot them now.&quot;&#10;&quot;If you want to try this yourself, here&#39;s a quickstart guide: [link].&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"All the code I showed today is available on GitHub at [link].\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I've written a detailed blog post that goes deeper into this topic.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"The slides are available at [link]. Feel free to screenshot them now.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"If you want to try this yourself, here's a quickstart guide: [link].\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"结束语\">结束语</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Thank you for your time and attention.&quot;&#10;&quot;Thanks everyone. I&#39;m happy to chat more after the session.&quot;&#10;&quot;Thank you. I&#39;ll be around during the break if you want to discuss further.&quot;&#10;&quot;That&#39;s all I have. Thank you, and enjoy the rest of the conference.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Thank you for your time and attention.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Thanks everyone. I'm happy to chat more after the session.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Thank you. I'll be around during the break if you want to discuss further.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"That's all I have. Thank you, and enjoy the rest of the conference.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"发音与表达技巧\">发音与表达技巧</h2><h3 id=\"技术术语发音注意\">技术术语发音注意</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>正确发音</th>\n<th>常见错误</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>cache</td>\n<td>/kæʃ/ (cash)</td>\n<td><del>&quot;ka-shay&quot;</del></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>sudo</td>\n<td>/ˈsuːduː/</td>\n<td><del>&quot;sue-doe&quot;</del></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>nginx</td>\n<td>/ˈɛndʒɪnˌɛks/ (engine-X)</td>\n<td><del>&quot;N-jinx&quot;</del></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SQL</td>\n<td>/ˈsiːkwəl/ 或 /ˌɛsˌkjuːˈɛl/</td>\n<td>两种都可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>char</td>\n<td>/tʃɑːr/ (像 charcoal 的开头)</td>\n<td><del>&quot;car&quot;</del></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Linux</td>\n<td>/ˈlɪnəks/</td>\n<td><del>&quot;lie-nux&quot;</del></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GUI</td>\n<td>/ˈɡuːi/ (gooey)</td>\n<td><del>&quot;G-U-I&quot;</del> 逐字母也可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OAuth</td>\n<td>/ˈoʊˌɔːθ/ (oh-auth)</td>\n<td><del>&quot;O-auth&quot;</del></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kubernetes</td>\n<td>/kuːbərˈnɛtiːz/</td>\n<td><del>&quot;koo-ber-nay-tees&quot;</del></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PostgreSQL</td>\n<td>/ˈpoʊstɡrɛs/ (just &quot;postgres&quot;)</td>\n<td><del>&quot;post-gree-sequel&quot;</del></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"演讲节奏建议\">演讲节奏建议</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"- 关键概念后停顿 2-3 秒，让听众消化&#10;- 代码演示时放慢语速，确保观众能跟上&#10;- 数字和重要术语要重读强调&#10;- 用 &quot;So...&quot; &quot;Now...&quot; &quot;Okay...&quot; 作为自然的节奏标记&#10;- 保持与观众的目光接触，不要一直盯着屏幕\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>- 关键概念后停顿 2-3 秒，让听众消化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 代码演示时放慢语速，确保观众能跟上</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 数字和重要术语要重读强调</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 用 \"So...\" \"Now...\" \"Okay...\" 作为自然的节奏标记</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 保持与观众的目光接触，不要一直盯着屏幕</span></span></code></pre></div><p>技术演讲能力是可以通过刻意练习来提升的。从 5 分钟的团队内部分享开始，逐步挑战更长、受众更广的演讲。每次演讲后记录哪些表达用得顺、哪些地方卡壳，持续积累你的个人演讲词库。</p>\n<h2 id=\"线上-tech-talk-q-a-的英语\">线上 Tech Talk + Q&amp;A 的英语</h2><p>远程优先时代，绝大多数 tech talk 实际发生在 Zoom / Google Meet / 线上 conference。与线下相比，<strong>视觉信号弱、网络延迟、参与者多任务</strong>三个特征改变了演讲与 Q&amp;A 英语。</p>\n<h3 id=\"线上演讲的英语适配\">线上演讲的英语适配</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# 开场（必加远程语境信号）&#10;&quot;Hi everyone — glad you could join, especially those of you joining&#10;from late evening time zones. Drop a 👍 in the chat if you can see&#10;my slides and hear me OK.&quot;&#10;&#10;# 检查频道&#10;&quot;I&#39;ll be watching the chat throughout, so feel free to drop questions&#10;as they come up. I&#39;ll batch-answer at the end of each section.&quot;&#10;&#10;# 切换演示&#10;&quot;Let me share my IDE for the next part. If you can&#39;t see it, ping&#10;me in chat — I won&#39;t be able to spot it visually.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 开场（必加远程语境信号）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Hi everyone — glad you could join, especially those of you joining</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>from late evening time zones. Drop a 👍 in the chat if you can see</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>my slides and hear me OK.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 检查频道</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I'll be watching the chat throughout, so feel free to drop questions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>as they come up. I'll batch-answer at the end of each section.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 切换演示</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Let me share my IDE for the next part. If you can't see it, ping</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>me in chat — I won't be able to spot it visually.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>线上特有的句式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>drop {emoji/text} in the chat</code> — 替代举手</li>\n<li><code>I won&#39;t be able to spot it visually</code> — 提示你看不到所有人</li>\n<li><code>for those joining late</code> — 远程加入者随时进出，需要随时小复盘</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"处理网络问题的英语\">处理网络问题的英语</h3><p>技术故障是线上演讲的常态。准备好这几句：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&quot;Sorry, my audio cut out — could someone confirm I&#39;m back?&quot;&#10;&quot;My screen share dropped. Reconnecting now.&quot;&#10;&quot;There&#39;s some lag on my end. Let me re-share.&quot;&#10;&quot;Could you repeat that question? I think your audio cut out.&quot;&#10;&quot;Let&#39;s keep going — if I freeze, give me a few seconds before pinging.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>\"Sorry, my audio cut out — could someone confirm I'm back?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"My screen share dropped. Reconnecting now.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"There's some lag on my end. Let me re-share.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Could you repeat that question? I think your audio cut out.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Let's keep going — if I freeze, give me a few seconds before pinging.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>关键短语</strong>：<code>cut out</code>（突然中断）vs <code>lag</code>（卡顿）vs <code>freeze</code>（完全停住）—— 不要混用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"q-a-环节的线上特化\">Q&amp;A 环节的线上特化</h3><p>线上 Q&amp;A 比线下更需要<strong>结构化复述</strong>——因为参与者听不清提问者的麦克风：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# 复述提问（必做）&#10;&quot;Great question — for everyone, the question was: &#39;Why did you pick&#10;Postgres over MongoDB for the event store?&#39; My answer is...&quot;&#10;&#10;# 处理无人提问的尴尬&#10;&quot;Looks like no immediate questions — I&#39;ll wait 10 seconds in case&#10;anyone is typing. Otherwise, I&#39;ll move on and circle back if questions&#10;come up later.&quot;&#10;&#10;# 当多人同时插话&#10;&quot;Sorry, I heard two people start at once — Alex first, then Maria?&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 复述提问（必做）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Great question — for everyone, the question was: 'Why did you pick</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Postgres over MongoDB for the event store?' My answer is...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 处理无人提问的尴尬</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Looks like no immediate questions — I'll wait 10 seconds in case</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>anyone is typing. Otherwise, I'll move on and circle back if questions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>come up later.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 当多人同时插话</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Sorry, I heard two people start at once — Alex first, then Maria?\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"q-a-中的-不知道-线上版\">Q&amp;A 中的&quot;不知道&quot;——线上版</h3><p>线下&quot;我不知道&quot;可以靠眼神和表情软化；线上必须<strong>用语言补足</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# Bad — 太简洁，线上像在敷衍&#10;&quot;I don&#39;t know.&quot;&#10;&#10;# Good — 加 follow-up 承诺&#10;&quot;Honestly, I haven&#39;t benchmarked that specific case. Let me check&#10;after the talk and reply in {channel} — what&#39;s a good handle to ping?&quot;&#10;&#10;# Good — 邀请群体智慧&#10;&quot;I don&#39;t have a definitive answer — anyone in the audience with&#10;production experience on this want to chime in?&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Bad — 太简洁，线上像在敷衍</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I don't know.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Good — 加 follow-up 承诺</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Honestly, I haven't benchmarked that specific case. Let me check</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>after the talk and reply in {channel} — what's a good handle to ping?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Good — 邀请群体智慧</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"I don't have a definitive answer — anyone in the audience with</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>production experience on this want to chime in?\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"录播观众的英语提示\">录播观众的英语提示</h3><p>线上 talk 通常会被录制，部分观众是录播观看：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# 开场提示&#10;&quot;This session is being recorded — the recording will be in&#10;{location} within 48 hours.&quot;&#10;&#10;# 演示前&#10;&quot;For those watching the recording, the code we&#39;ll cover is at&#10;{repo URL} — feel free to clone and follow along.&quot;&#10;&#10;# 结尾提示&#10;&quot;Thanks everyone — the slides and recording will go up later today.&#10;DMs are open for follow-up questions.&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 开场提示</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"This session is being recorded — the recording will be in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{location} within 48 hours.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 演示前</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"For those watching the recording, the code we'll cover is at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{repo URL} — feel free to clone and follow along.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 结尾提示</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"Thanks everyone — the slides and recording will go up later today.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>DMs are open for follow-up questions.\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"跨时区-panel-圆桌的英语\">跨时区 panel / 圆桌的英语</h3><p>当你参加多人 panel 而不是独白：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>模板</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>礼让发言权</td>\n<td>&quot;I&#39;ll defer to {Name} on this — they have deeper experience in {area}.&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>抢答 / 补充</td>\n<td>&quot;Quick add to what {Name} said —&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>委婉不同意</td>\n<td>&quot;I&#39;d nuance that a bit — in our context, X actually...&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>切回主持人</td>\n<td>&quot;Back to you, {moderator}.&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong><code>I&#39;d nuance that</code></strong> 是高级表达 —— 比 &quot;I disagree&quot; 软、比 &quot;yes and&quot; 真。Panel 英语的关键是<strong>节奏感</strong>：插话点准、退出点干净。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>技术演讲是有固定节奏的独白：开场 → 主体 → Demo → Q&amp;A → 结尾，每段都有成熟句式</li>\n<li>开场前 30 秒要同时建立信任、激发兴趣、设定期望；自我介绍控制在 2-3 句</li>\n<li>三种话题引入模式：问题导入、数据导入、故事导入</li>\n<li>主体用幻灯片衔接句与类比讲清复杂概念（<code>Think of it like...</code> + 分步分解）</li>\n<li>Live Demo 边操作边解说，并准备好处理演示出错的台词</li>\n<li>Q&amp;A 四类应对：直接回答、需要思考、不知道（给 follow-up 承诺）、把问题转化为讨论</li>\n<li>结尾用 &quot;three key takeaways&quot; 总结、提供后续资源、给结束语</li>\n<li>发音陷阱表（cache / nginx / Kubernetes / PostgreSQL 等）与演讲节奏建议是长期练习清单</li>\n<li>线上 Talk 额外适配：远程语境开场、网络故障套语（<code>cut out</code> / <code>lag</code> / <code>freeze</code> 不混用）、Q&amp;A 结构化复述、跨时区 panel 的礼让与切回主持人</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"技术演讲英语","id":"技术演讲英语"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"开场白的设计","id":"开场白的设计"},{"level":3,"text":"自我介绍","id":"自我介绍"},{"level":3,"text":"话题引入模式","id":"话题引入模式"},{"level":3,"text":"大纲预告","id":"大纲预告"},{"level":2,"text":"幻灯片衔接与内容讲解","id":"幻灯片衔接与内容讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"幻灯片切换句式","id":"幻灯片切换句式"},{"level":3,"text":"解释图表和架构图","id":"解释图表和架构图"},{"level":3,"text":"描述数据与指标","id":"描述数据与指标"},{"level":3,"text":"解释复杂概念","id":"解释复杂概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Live Demo 的英语表达","id":"live-demo-的英语表达"},{"level":3,"text":"开始演示","id":"开始演示"},{"level":3,"text":"边操作边解说","id":"边操作边解说"},{"level":3,"text":"处理演示出错","id":"处理演示出错"},{"level":2,"text":"Q&A 环节应对","id":"q-a-环节应对"},{"level":3,"text":"开启问答","id":"开启问答"},{"level":3,"text":"接收问题","id":"接收问题"},{"level":3,"text":"回答模式","id":"回答模式"},{"level":3,"text":"处理挑战性问题","id":"处理挑战性问题"},{"level":2,"text":"结尾的艺术","id":"结尾的艺术"},{"level":3,"text":"总结要点","id":"总结要点"},{"level":3,"text":"提供后续资源","id":"提供后续资源"},{"level":3,"text":"结束语","id":"结束语"},{"level":2,"text":"发音与表达技巧","id":"发音与表达技巧"},{"level":3,"text":"技术术语发音注意","id":"技术术语发音注意"},{"level":3,"text":"演讲节奏建议","id":"演讲节奏建议"},{"level":2,"text":"线上 Tech Talk + Q&A 的英语","id":"线上-tech-talk-q-a-的英语"},{"level":3,"text":"线上演讲的英语适配","id":"线上演讲的英语适配"},{"level":3,"text":"处理网络问题的英语","id":"处理网络问题的英语"},{"level":3,"text":"Q&A 环节的线上特化","id":"q-a-环节的线上特化"},{"level":3,"text":"Q&A 中的\"不知道\"——线上版","id":"q-a-中的-不知道-线上版"},{"level":3,"text":"录播观众的英语提示","id":"录播观众的英语提示"},{"level":3,"text":"跨时区 panel / 圆桌的英语","id":"跨时区-panel-圆桌的英语"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"远程协作沟通英语","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/programmer-english/communication-english/remote-collaboration"},"next":{"title":"开源协作英语","url":"/l-doc-books/h/english-learning/programmer-english/communication-english/open-source-collaboration-english"}}